# Script output — regenerate with hack/scripts/*, never commit.
# These are dated state dumps, not intent: they describe a cluster that has
# already changed. Ignored by directory rather than by content, because the diag
# scripts keep growing and one future line dumping a node-token or kubeconfig
# would otherwise land in permanent history.
hack/logs/
hack/scripts/tailscale-subnet-router-prompt-v2.md
